    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly is delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment located on the first floor of the landmark Elmpark development. Designed with contemporary living in mind, the property benefits from floor-to-ceiling glazing, generous proportions, and a high standard of finish throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with excellent storage, a large open-plan living and dining space with a fully fitted kitchen featuring integrated appliances, two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, the main en-suite, and a stylish main bathroom.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nElm Park is an award-winning, 17-acre campus with on-site amenities, including the Giraffe creche, the Epicurean Specialty Food & Wine outlet, The Art of Coffee cafe, the Fianna Gym & Wellness Centre, and The Club at Elm Park which organises a range of activities for residents.\r\n\r\nThere is easy access to public transport links, including the DART and the Dublin Bus QBCs, local retail and leisure amenities at the Merrion Centre, Donnybrook, Sandymount and Blackrock Villages and is an easy commute to Ballsbridge and Dublin City Centre. The scheme is within easy reach of pleasant seaside walks at both Merrion Strand, and the UCD Belfield Campus, and is close to St. Vincent's Hospital and the RTE Studios."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "First-floor apartment in landmark development.\r\nTwo double bedrooms, main en-suite.\r\nSpacious open-plan living and dining area.\r\nConcierge service & landscaped gardens.\r\nSecure underground parking included.\r\nPrime Dublin 4 location.\r\nMonitored CCTV security system throughout the development.\r\nWalking distance to Booterstown and Sydney Parade DART stations."
      },
      {
